('127.262.d.9.C',4,'''This jacket is made of waterproof fabric'' states a feature, and ''you stay dry in storms'' states a:','["Feature", "Warranty", "Cost", "Benefit"]'::jsonb,3,'Benefit to the buyer.','original'),
