('127.262.d.12.D',4,'Open-ended questions such as ''What features matter most?'' help a seller to:','["Confuse customers", "Discover buying motives", "End the sale", "Avoid talking"]'::jsonb,1,'They draw out detail.','original'),
('127.262.d.13.A',3,'The first step of the selling process after preparation is:','["Closing the sale", "Delivery", "Approaching the customer", "Follow-up"]'::jsonb,2,'Approach begins contact.','original'),
('127.262.d.13.A',4,'After presenting a product, a salesperson handles:','["Prices of rent", "Layoffs", "Taxes", "Objections"]'::jsonb,3,'Address concerns.','original'),
('127.262.d.13.B',3,'A salesperson dealing with a hesitant buyer should:','["Listen and address concerns", "Leave", "Argue", "Pressure harder"]'::jsonb,0,'Respond to needs.','original'),
