('127.262.d.13.C',4,'Using a demonstration or sample in a pitch helps to:','["Raise price", "Confuse the buyer", "Delay the sale", "Show the product''s value"]'::jsonb,3,'Demonstration persuades.','original'),
('127.262.d.14.A',3,'A key target audience for a promotion is the group:','["Most likely to respond", "Who never shops", "Who dislikes the product", "Who cannot buy"]'::jsonb,0,'Define who to reach.','original'),
